   "description": "Designed with the perfect balance of practicality and ease, the watch comes with a contemporary 40mm bezel diameter and 48mm lug to lug size, making it the ideal accessory for daily wear. At a mere 12mm thickness, it nestles comfortably on your wrist. The Seiko NH34 GMT automatic movement with date ensures dependable and precise timekeeping, making the Oracle GMT the ultimate timepiece for any escapade or event. The sapphire crystal with an anti-reflective coating on the inside guarantees that the watch face remains effortlessly legible, while the sapphire crystal bezel insert adorned with BGW9 Swiss Superluminova numerals enhances its robustness and functionality. Crafted to endure, the Oracle GMT showcases a 316L stainless steel case and bracelet and a micro-adjustment clasp for a secure and snug fit. With a water resistance of up to 200 metres, it is ready to accompany you on all your thrilling adventures. Adorning the Oracle GMT serves as a testament to the abiding allure and splendour of ancient customs. It forges a connection to a rich heritage and culture that continues to captivate and astound us to this day. MOVEMENT Japanese Seiko NH34 GMT Mechanical DIMENSIONS Bezel Width - 40mm excluding crown Case Thickness - 12.6 mm including crystal Lug to Lug - 48mm MATERIALS Case - 316L Stainless Steel CRYSTAL Sapphire Crystal with Anti-Reflective coating Bezel Sapphire Crystal with BGW9 Swiss Superluminova DIAL Black and Silver with BGW9 and Old Radium Swiss Superluminova Bracelet 316L Stainless Steel with Quick-Release system WATER RESISTANCE 20 ATM / 200 Meters WEIGHT 148g WARRANTY 24 Month Warranty from the purchase date",
